      "writtenOn": "2022-05-13T19:31:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right (and this approach permits that as well). The language to support this in the GLSL spec is fairly explicit, but also seems to suggest that maybe it *shouldn\u0027t* work. Given that we don\u0027t have a preprocessor (or line continuation), I\u0027m not real worried yet - but it also creates issues if our approach to preprocessor support is to have our clients do it (#version is *not* considered a preprocessor directive, and actually happens first).",
      "parentUuid": "052379c1_ea0e7b50",
